  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can replenish your ki more quickly.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can replenish a single ki point by meditating as a full-round action that invokes attacks of opportunity. You can use this ability a number of times per a day equal to your Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Characters can replenish their ki pool each morning after 8 hours of rest or meditation.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc101\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
